    {"line_id": "P1L018", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 18, "order": 18, "text": "Part II: Fill in the Blanks (2 points each, 10 points total)", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L019", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 19, "order": 19, "text": "4. She has been working as a teacher ______ 2015.", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L020", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 20, "order": 20, "text": "5. The project ______ (complete) by next month.", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L021", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 21, "order": 21, "text": "Part III: Cloze (2 points each, 10 points total)", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L022", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 22, "order": 22, "text": "The Internet has changed the way people communicate. It has made it possible for people in different parts of the world to keep in touch with each other easily.", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L023", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 23, "order": 23, "text": "6. ______ the development of technology, people can now share information more quickly than ever before.", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L024", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 24, "order": 24, "text": "A. With", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L025", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 25, "order": 25, "text": "B. For", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L026", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 26, "order": 26, "text": "C. By", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L027", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 27, "order": 27, "text": "D. On", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L028", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 28, "order": 28, "text": "7. Email and social media ______ for faster communication between friends and family.", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L029", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 29, "order": 29, "text": "A. allow", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L030", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 30, "order": 30, "text": "B. are allowed", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L031", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 31, "order": 31, "text": "C. will be allowed", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L032", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 32, "order": 32, "text": "D. have allowed", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L033", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 33, "order": 33, "text": "8. However, some people worry about the negative effects of ______ too much time online.", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L034", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 34, "order": 34, "text": "A. spend", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
