    {"line_id": "P1L036", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 36, "order": 36, "text": "C. spent", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L037", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 37, "order": 37, "text": "D. to spend", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L038", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 38, "order": 38, "text": "9. Studies show that students who use the Internet wisely ______ better results in their studies.", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L039", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 39, "order": 39, "text": "A. achieve", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L040", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 40, "order": 40, "text": "B. achieved", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L041", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 41, "order": 41, "text": "C. have achieved", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L042", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 42, "order": 42, "text": "D. are achieving", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L043", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 43, "order": 43, "text": "10. In conclusion, the Internet is a useful tool ______ we must learn to use properly.", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
