    {"line_id": "P1L056", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 56, "order": 56, "text": "8. B", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L057", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 57, "order": 57, "text": "9. A", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L058", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 58, "order": 58, "text": "10. B", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L059", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 59, "order": 59, "text": "Explanations", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L060", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 60, "order": 60, "text": "1. 被动语态：The book was published by the famous author last year.", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L061", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 61, "order": 61, "text": "2. 虚拟语气：与过去事实相反，if 从句用 had done，主句用 would have done。", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L062", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 62, "order": 62, "text": "3. 定语从句：the reason 后用 that 引导表语从句，不用 which。", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L063", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 63, "order": 63, "text": "4. since + 时间点，表示从 2015 年至今，用现在完成进行时。", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L064", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 64, "order": 64, "text": "5. by next month 表示将来，project 与 complete 是被动关系，用一般将来时被动语态。", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L065", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 65, "order": 65, "text": "6. with 表示伴随，with the development of technology = 随着技术的发展。", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L066", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 66, "order": 66, "text": "7. 陈述客观事实用一般现在时；email and social media 是复数主语，用 allow。", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L067", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 67, "order": 67, "text": "8. of 是介词，后面接动名词 spending，表示“花费太多时间上网的负面影响”。", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L068", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 68, "order": 68, "text": "9. 陈述客观事实/研究结论用一般现在时；students 是复数，用 achieve。", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false},
    {"line_id": "P1L069", "page_no": 1, "line_no_in_page": 69, "order": 69, "text": "10. 定语从句：先行词 tool 是物，用 which 引导；that 不引导定语从句，where 先行词需是地点。", "block_type": "text", "source": "native", "continuation": false}
